        <elementInformation name="notes" show="1">Viri: Datasheet - Sigen Energy Gateway (for SigenStor) C60-2 / C120-6 / C180-9 / C300-12 / C600 / C1200, Sigenergy str. 2; Sigen Gateway (C120-6, TPLV C70-6) Installation Guide, v03 (2025-03-27) str. 2 (Port Description), 3 (notranjost KM1/KM2/QS1/QF), 5 (kabli, OT M12), 12-13 (komunikacija); Sigen Energy Gateway C&amp;I Series User Manual, v08 (2026-08-24) str. 24-26 (C60-2), 30-32 (C120-6), 33-35 (C180-9/C300-12), 36-45 (C600/C1200/-B); Application Note - How to connect the Generator to Sigen Energy Gateway</elementInformation>
